  "date": "2026-11-11",
  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "美国10月物价涨0.4%，比预期高",
  "title_en": "US prices rose 0.4% in October, higher than expected",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "美国劳工部11月10日公布了10月的消费者价格指数，也就是CPI。CPI是用来看物价变化的一个重要数字。数据显示，10月CPI比9月上涨了0.4%，市场原来估计只涨0.3%。9月的涨幅是0.6%。",
      "en": "On November 10, the US Department of Labor released the consumer price index for October, also known as the CPI. The CPI is an important number used to track changes in prices. The data showed that the October CPI rose 0.4% from September, while the market had expected a rise of only 0.3%. The increase in September was 0.6%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "去掉食品和能源以后，核心CPI上涨了0.3%，也比预期的0.2%高。这个数字和8月、9月一样。去年美国政府停摆，2025年10月的数据不够，所以这次没有公布和去年同期相比的涨幅。",
      "en": "Leaving out food and energy, core CPI rose 0.3%, also higher than the expected 0.2%. This number was the same as in August and September. Because of the US government shutdown last year, there was not enough data for October 2025, so this time no year-on-year increase was published."
    },
    {
      "zh": "分类来看，能源价格涨了0.7%，其中汽油涨了1%。食品价格涨了0.5%，牛肉涨了0.9%。二手车和卡车的价格下降了1.2%。",
      "en": "By category, energy prices rose 0.7%, with gasoline up 1%. Food prices rose 0.5%, and beef rose 0.9%. Prices of used cars and trucks fell 1.2%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "美联储10月没有改变利率，目前利率是3.75%到4%。美联储理事沃勒在数据公布前一天表示，如果数据没有变好，12月的会议应该考虑一次加息50个基点。一个基点是0.01%。数据公布后，两年期美国国债收益率上升了13个基点，到了4.68%。",
      "en": "The Federal Reserve did not change interest rates in October; the rate is currently 3.75% to 4%. Fed Governor Waller said the day before the data release that if the data do not improve, the December meeting should consider a single 50-basis-point rate hike. One basis point is 0.01%. After the data came out, the yield on 2-year US Treasury bonds rose 13 basis points to 4.68%."
    }
  ],
